  "system": {
    "identifier": "shoton-crystal-release-crystal-ammunition",
    "description": "<p>You manifest a d10 stack of ammunition made of crystal. This ammunition can be used for any weapon that requires it. This ammunition has no bulk, and you can only have 1 stack of it at a time. If you manifest another stack, the previous stack dissolves.</p>\n<p>When using this ammunition, weapons whose damage die is less than 1d8, becomes 1d8 and its damage type becomes Earth. Additionally, attacks made using this ammunition gain the Deadly 2 weapon property and the weapon used is counted as a Crystal Weapon.</p>",
